pkcs7-windows: inspect signatures for algorithms, issuer, digest, TSA (#5581)

Adds pkcs7_windows_inspect: from a PKCS#7 /Contents blob, report hash and
signature algorithms, the message digest, issuer/expiry, eIDAS qcStatements,
CAdES attributes, and an RFC 3161 timestamp token when present.

https://github.com/sumatrapdfreader/sumatrapdf/issues/5581

---
